<title>USA: MMI to buy back up to $15 mln in stock.</title>
<headline>MMI to buy back up to $15 mln in stock.</headline>
<dateline>DEERFIELD, Ill. 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>MMI Cos Inc said Monday its board of directors authorized a program to repurchase up to $15.0 million of its common stock at the discretion of the chairman of the board.</p>
<p>On January 31, MMI had 11,734,756 shares of common stock outstanding.  </p>
<p>MMI provides products to help the healthcare industry manage risks.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
